      "H2: The Trap of 'Free' Commercial Sites and Redirect Links",
      "The most common issue with online platforms is the bait-and-switch. Thousands of generators promote themselves as free in search results but compile 'dynamic' redirect URLs owned by their servers. When you print these codes on thousands of business brochures, they deactivate the link after 14 days, forcing you into expensive plans ($30-$90/month) to restore access.",
